IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g6-interpretation`
IMPORT `g6-art15-16-deregistration`
IMPORT `g6-art17-after-deregistration`
IMPORT `g6-art18-governor-duties`
IMPORT `g6-art19-reportable-matters`
IMPORT `g6-art20-court-orders`

-- ind-b-tests-fixtures-g6: the fixtures of test author ind-b for Articles 15 to 20 (group G6).  No assertions: the facts here are the scenarios of
-- work/ind-b/expectations.md, put into the shapes of the G6 modules.

§ `ind-b fixtures for Articles 15 to 20`

GIVEN p IS A TYPE
      a IS A TYPE
      d IS A DEONTIC p a
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b6 nothing is owed under` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`ind-b6 A` MEANS `the readings taken`
`ind-b6 day` MEANS YMD 2026 3 1

GIVEN standing IS A `Standing on the register`
      kind IS A `Kind of entity`
GIVETH AN Entity
`ind-b6 entity` standing kind MEANS
    Entity WITH
        name IS "the test charity"
        `standing on the register` IS standing
        `kinds of entity` IS LIST kind
        `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
        governors IS EMPTY
        purposes IS EMPTY

GIVEN name IS A STRING
      matters IS A LIST OF `Kind of reportable matter`
GIVETH A Governor
`ind-b6 governor` name matters MEANS
    Governor WITH
        name IS name
        `is a natural person` IS TRUE
        `is resident in Jersey` IS TRUE
        `is itself a Jersey entity by virtue of Article 2(3)(a)` IS FALSE
        `reportable matters` IS matters

GIVETH A `Standing on the register`
`ind-b6 general` MEANS `entered in the general section`
GIVETH A `Standing on the register`
`ind-b6 applicant` MEANS `an applicant for registration`

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b6 a registered company charity` MEANS
    `Registered charity` WITH
        entity IS `ind-b6 entity` `ind-b6 general` `a company`
        `registration number` IS "CH-0002"
        `registered name` IS "The Test Charity"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2019 1 10
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "the advancement of education"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "education of children in Jersey"
        `is an organized religious charity` IS FALSE

-- Article 16: the preliminary notice given on 2026-01-10, objections invited until 2026-02-10.
GIVEN writing IS A BOOLEAN
      reasons IS A BOOLEAN
      invites IS A BOOLEAN
      reasonable IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Preliminary notice of Article 16(1)`
`ind-b6 notice` writing reasons invites reasonable MEANS
    `Preliminary notice of Article 16(1)` WITH
        `given on` IS YMD 2026 1 10
        `the last day for objections` IS YMD 2026 2 10
        `in writing` IS writing
        `specifies reasons` IS reasons
        `invites objections within a time it specifies` IS invites
        `the time specified is reasonable` IS reasonable

`ind-b6 a proper notice` MEANS `ind-b6 notice` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE

GIVEN misled IS A BOOLEAN
      prescribed IS A BOOLEAN
      proportionate IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facts about the grounds of Article 16(1)`
`ind-b6 grounds` misled prescribed proportionate MEANS
    `Facts about the grounds of Article 16(1)` WITH
        `the Commissioner was misled into registering the entity` IS misled
        `a circumstance prescribed by Order under Article 16(1)(d) applies` IS prescribed
        `the Commissioner is satisfied that it is proportionate to deregister on a ground` IS proportionate

-- A required steps notice served on the charity, not complied with, steps due by 2026-02-01.
`ind-b6 an unmet notice` MEANS
    `Required steps notice` WITH
        `served on` IS `the registered charity`
        `prompted by` IS `there has been misconduct by a registered charity`
        `date served` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `steps to be taken by` IS JUST (YMD 2026 2 1)
        `requires a governor to be suspended, removed or replaced` IS FALSE
        `has been complied with` IS FALSE

GIVEN meets IS A BOOLEAN
      notices IS A LIST OF `Required steps notice`
      grounds IS A `Facts about the grounds of Article 16(1)`
      notice IS A MAYBE `Preliminary notice of Article 16(1)`
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b6 the Commissioner may deregister` meets notices grounds notice day MEANS
    NOT `ind-b6 nothing is owed under` (`Art 16(1) the Commissioner may deregister the entity` `ind-b6 A` TRUE meets notices grounds notice day)

-- Article 17: a deregistration.  `since` is the past date the Commissioner is satisfied of and specifies in the deregistration notice.
GIVEN route IS A `Route by which the Commissioner deregistered the entity`
      dated IS A DATE
      preliminary IS A MAYBE DATE
      since IS A MAYBE DATE
      specified IS A MAYBE DATE
      determines IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Deregistration of the entity`
`ind-b6 deregistration` route dated preliminary since specified determines MEANS
    `Deregistration of the entity` WITH
        route IS route
        `date of the deregistration` IS dated
        `date of the preliminary notice` IS preliminary
        `the Commissioner is satisfied that the grounds have existed since` IS since
        `past date specified in the deregistration notice` IS specified
        `past date specified in the preliminary notice` IS specified
        `the Commissioner determines that the deregistration takes effect retrospectively` IS determines

`ind-b6 misled` MEANS `by written notice under Article 16(1) on the ground that the Commissioner was misled into registering the entity`

-- E17-01..E17-07: deregistered by notice on 2020-03-15, not retrospective.
`ind-b6 deregistered on 15 March 2020` MEANS `ind-b6 deregistration` `ind-b6 misled` (YMD 2020 3 15) (JUST (YMD 2020 2 1)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE
-- E17-05, E17-06: deregistered on 2020-02-29.
`ind-b6 deregistered on 29 February 2020` MEANS `ind-b6 deregistration` `ind-b6 misled` (YMD 2020 2 29) (JUST (YMD 2020 2 1)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE
-- E17-08: retrospective to 2020-01-01, the deregistration notice given 2020-03-15.
`ind-b6 retrospective to 1 January 2020` MEANS `ind-b6 deregistration` `ind-b6 misled` (YMD 2020 3 15) (JUST (YMD 2020 2 1)) (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) TRUE
-- E17-14 to E17-18: retrospective to 2020-01-01, the preliminary notice given 2020-06-01, the deregistration notice 2020-07-01.
`ind-b6 retrospective, notice of 1 July 2020` MEANS `ind-b6 deregistration` `ind-b6 misled` (YMD 2020 7 1) (JUST (YMD 2020 6 1)) (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) TRUE
-- E17-20 to E17-22: deregistered on its own application on 2020-03-15.
`ind-b6 deregistered on application` MEANS `ind-b6 deregistration` `on the entity's own application under Article 15(3)(a)` (YMD 2020 3 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE

GIVEN acquired IS A DATE
      remains IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Property of the charity`
`ind-b6 property` acquired remains MEANS `Property of the charity` WITH description IS "a building", `acquired on` IS acquired, remains IS remains

-- Article 18: a governor's conduct.
GIVEN name IS A STRING
      own IS A BOOLEAN
      concurs IS A BOOLEAN
      assists IS A LIST OF STRING
      aware IS A BOOLEAN
      conceals IS A BOOLEAN
      fails IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Conduct of a governor for Article 18(4)`
`ind-b6 conduct` name own concurs assists aware conceals fails MEANS
    `Conduct of a governor for Article 18(4)` WITH
        name IS name
        `the conduct is misconduct within Article 2(10)` IS own
        `concurs in the misconduct of the charity` IS concurs
        `assists or encourages these other governors to engage in misconduct` IS assists
        `becomes aware or ought to have become aware of misconduct, or of the intention of another governor to engage in it` IS aware
        `actively conceals that misconduct or that intention` IS conceals
        `continues the concealment beyond a reasonable time` IS FALSE
        `fails within a reasonable time to take proper steps to protect or restore the property of the charity or to prevent the misconduct` IS fails

GIVEN charity IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A `Conduct of a governor for Article 18(4)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b6 alone, misconduct of` charity g MEANS
    `Art 18(4) the governor engages in misconduct` `ind-b6 A` charity (LIST g) g

`ind-b6 innocent` MEANS `ind-b6 conduct` "A. Innocent" FALSE FALSE EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE

-- Article 19(1): the facts about a person; every limb false unless given.
GIVETH A `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)`
`ind-b6 a clean person` MEANS
    `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)` WITH
        `conduct as a governor` IS `ind-b6 innocent`
        `the governors of the charity` IS LIST `ind-b6 innocent`
        `the conduct of the charity is misconduct within Article 2(10)` IS FALSE
        `the misconduct led to the service of a required steps notice` IS FALSE
        `disqualification orders under this Law` IS EMPTY
        `subject to another restriction on acting as a governor under this Law` IS FALSE
        `disqualifications as a charity trustee or an equivalent` IS EMPTY
        `disqualifications as a company director or an equivalent outside Jersey` IS EMPTY
        `bankrupt or otherwise insolvent` IS FALSE
        convictions IS EMPTY
        `falls within another description prescribed by Order` IS FALSE

GIVEN led IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)`
`ind-b6 a governor whose own misconduct, with a notice served, led` led MEANS
    `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)` WITH
        `conduct as a governor` IS `ind-b6 conduct` "A. Innocent" TRUE FALSE EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE
        `the governors of the charity` IS LIST (`ind-b6 conduct` "A. Innocent" TRUE FALSE EMPTY FALSE FALSE FALSE)
        `the conduct of the charity is misconduct within Article 2(10)` IS FALSE
        `the misconduct led to the service of a required steps notice` IS led
        `disqualification orders under this Law` IS EMPTY
        `subject to another restriction on acting as a governor under this Law` IS FALSE
        `disqualifications as a charity trustee or an equivalent` IS EMPTY
        `disqualifications as a company director or an equivalent outside Jersey` IS EMPTY
        `bankrupt or otherwise insolvent` IS FALSE
        convictions IS EMPTY
        `falls within another description prescribed by Order` IS FALSE

GIVEN orders IS A LIST OF `Disqualification order`
      restriction IS A BOOLEAN
      trustee IS A LIST OF `Disqualification elsewhere`
      director IS A LIST OF `Disqualification elsewhere`
      bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN
      convictions IS A LIST OF `Conviction of a person`
      prescribed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)`
`ind-b6 a person with` orders restriction trustee director bankrupt convictions prescribed MEANS
    `Facts about a person for Article 19(1)` WITH
        `conduct as a governor` IS `ind-b6 innocent`
        `the governors of the charity` IS LIST `ind-b6 innocent`
        `the conduct of the charity is misconduct within Article 2(10)` IS FALSE
        `the misconduct led to the service of a required steps notice` IS FALSE
        `disqualification orders under this Law` IS orders
        `subject to another restriction on acting as a governor under this Law` IS restriction
        `disqualifications as a charity trustee or an equivalent` IS trustee
        `disqualifications as a company director or an equivalent outside Jersey` IS director
        `bankrupt or otherwise insolvent` IS bankrupt
        convictions IS convictions
        `falls within another description prescribed by Order` IS prescribed

`ind-b6 a disqualification of 2020 with no end` MEANS `Disqualification elsewhere` WITH `imposed on` IS YMD 2020 1 1, `last day in force` IS NOTHING
`ind-b6 a disqualification that ended in 2021` MEANS `Disqualification elsewhere` WITH `imposed on` IS YMD 2020 1 1, `last day in force` IS JUST (YMD 2021 1 1)

GIVEN thisLaw IS A BOOLEAN
      within IS A BOOLEAN
      spent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Conviction of a person`
`ind-b6 conviction` thisLaw within spent MEANS `Conviction of a person` WITH `for an offence under this Law` IS thisLaw, `for an offence falling within Article 2(10)(b)` IS within, spent IS spent

-- A disqualification order against "A. Innocent" from 2020-01-10 to `last`.
GIVEN last IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Disqualification order`
`ind-b6 disqualification order to` last MEANS `Disqualification order` WITH person IS "A. Innocent", `begins on` IS YMD 2020 1 10, `last day of the period` IS last

-- Article 19(2) and (10): what the governor reported and when.
GIVEN toCharity IS A MAYBE DATE
      toCommissioner IS A MAYBE DATE
      runOut IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Position of a governor under Article 19(2)`
`ind-b6 reports` toCharity toCommissioner runOut MEANS
    `Position of a governor under Article 19(2)` WITH
        `the matter arose on` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the governor became aware of the matter on` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `reported to the entity or charity on` IS toCharity
        `reported to the Commissioner on` IS toCommissioner
        `the reports were made promptly` IS TRUE
        `a prompt time has run out` IS runOut

`ind-b6 reported on 1 February 2026` MEANS `ind-b6 reports` (JUST (YMD 2026 2 1)) (JUST (YMD 2026 2 1)) FALSE

GIVEN source IS A `Source of a permission to act as a governor`
      withdrawn IS A MAYBE DATE
      determined IS A MAYBE DATE
      limit IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Permission to act as a governor`
`ind-b6 permission` source withdrawn determined limit MEANS
    `Permission to act as a governor` WITH
        source IS source
        `given on` IS YMD 2026 2 5
        `withdrawn on` IS withdrawn
        `the issue is determined on` IS determined
        `time limit ends on` IS limit

GIVEN reported IS A BOOLEAN
      court IS A BOOLEAN
      determined IS A BOOLEAN
      complied IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Reported matter under Article 19(9)`
`ind-b6 reported matter` reported court determined complied MEANS
    `Reported matter under Article 19(9)` WITH
        `the governor reported the matter to the Commissioner` IS reported
        `the Commissioner has applied to the court to determine the issue` IS court
        `the issue has been determined` IS determined
        `any resulting order or notice has been complied with` IS complied

GIVEN name IS A STRING
      reported IS A BOOLEAN
      declared IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Position of a governor for Article 19(5)`
`ind-b6 position` name reported declared MEANS `Position of a governor for Article 19(5)` WITH name IS name, `made a report under paragraph (2)` IS reported, `provided a declaration of no reportable matter` IS declared

-- A registered company charity categorized as an organized religious charity (Article 28), for F6.15.
GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b6 an organized religious charity` MEANS
    `Registered charity` WITH
        entity IS `ind-b6 entity` `ind-b6 general` `a company`
        `registration number` IS "CH-0003"
        `registered name` IS "The Test Church"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2019 1 10
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "the advancement of religion"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "worship open to all"
        `is an organized religious charity` IS TRUE

-- A governor's position under 19(2): the matter arose on 2026-01-01, the governor became aware on 2026-01-20, nothing reported yet.
`ind-b6 an unreported matter learned of late` MEANS
    `Position of a governor under Article 19(2)` WITH
        `the matter arose on` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the governor became aware of the matter on` IS YMD 2026 1 20
        `reported to the entity or charity on` IS NOTHING
        `reported to the Commissioner on` IS NOTHING
        `the reports were made promptly` IS FALSE
        `a prompt time has run out` IS FALSE
